        "reason": "The Data section explicitly states that Twitter and Reddit users with a BD diagnosis are identified automatically via self-reported diagnosis statements (e.g., 'I was diagnosed with BD-I last week'), extending diagnosis patterns and terms for BD from prior work; relevant blogs are manually identified and authors contacted for informed consent. This fully answers how individuals with bipolar disorder are identified."
